# Fabric Loom
.fabric/
**/.fabric/
# ModDevGradle (NeoForge / Forge 1.17-1.20.1)
.neoforge/
**/.neoforge/
# ForgeGradle 7 (LexForge) / RetroFuturaGradle (Legacy Forge)
.forge/
**/.forge/
# Decompiled / remapped Minecraft & mappings caches
.mc-cache/
**/.mc-cache/

# Datagen output (regenerated by the datagen run configs)
**/src/main/generated/
**/src/generated/resources/

# Dev run working directories
run/
runs/
**/run/
**/runs/

